# ============================================================================
# CHAOS REDUX - EVENT 039 ICON REGISTRY
# ============================================================================
# Overview:
# - This file binds the generated Event 039 ideas, decisions, missions,
#   categories, technologies, equipment, force profiles, faction emblem, and
#   achievement states to stable consumer names.
# - The image package is original fictional art. The two-frame faction strip
#   follows the vanilla faction-logo contract; achievement states remain
#   full-canvas triplets as required by the achievement consumer.
# ============================================================================

